                            <comment id="18636098" author="JIRAUSER138386" created="Fri, 23 Jan 2026 17:04:31 +0100"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=SVarath1&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;SVarath1&quot;&gt;Varatharajan, Siva [HCSUS NON-J&amp;amp;J]&lt;/a&gt; /&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=PMAES&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;PMAES&quot;&gt;Maes, Pascal [JRDBE]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;See Answers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1.Will it be a valid scenario to test when user measure with a GMP and non-GMP GxP level are recorded in Audit Trail as part of this User story? &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;Reply WVEM: Audit trail will be handled in &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-1169&quot; title=&quot;Balance Interface: Auto-Calculate Fit for GxP field and Auto-populate Balance Data Field with Balance Interface metadata&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-1169&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-1169&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (audit trail is traceable)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
