3.What is the significance of Compliance status column which we have already? &lt;font color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Extra information, not limited to Balance and pH meter but all equipments&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
4.&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-2678&quot; title=&quot;Execution of automated tests for release v3.0.0&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-2678&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-2678&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;-Step6-Is it not the case where Soonest should be consider from current Date?For Calibration Due date it is taking Past expired date which seems wrong, because seems calibration is valid till Jan28. Note: &lt;font color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Not an issue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;As expected&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;5.The time we get in Signals seems to be from Biovia which is in EDT/EST and as Ankita is testing from US it is showing in EST, could you please confirm when you check it, it got converted to your timezone? &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=PMAES&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;PMAES&quot;&gt;Maes, Pascal [JRDBE]&lt;/a&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;To Be Confirmed during Business Testing that User preferred local time is working fine.&lt;/b&gt;&#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
6.My understanding is the testing is being done in Non-GxP template experiments, don&apos;t we have to test this in GxP template? &lt;font color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Non-GxP template and GxP template are using the same Preparation Master and Preparation Sub Table templates where the functionality is build.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
7.Please change the affects version in US from 2.1.0 to 2.0.0 &lt;font color=&quot;#0747a6&quot;&gt;WIll Update&#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
