5.The time we get in Signals seems to be from Biovia which is in EDT/EST and as Ankita is testing from US it is showing in EST, could you please confirm when you check it, it got converted to your timezone?&lt;br/&gt;
6.My understanding is the testing is being done in Non-GxP template experiments, don&apos;t we have to test this in GxP template?&lt;br/&gt;
