                <customfields>
                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;A Signals Experiment with
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;one or more hub-connected balances in the Equipment Table (Equipment Class = Balance)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;the hub-connected balance(s) may contain one or more Biovia Calibration and Verification Events.&#160;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Sub Preparation Tables (with external action)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The User has added one or more internal references to items from &apos;GxP CISPro Materials&apos;, &apos;GxP Biovia Samples&apos; or &apos;Signals Inventory&apos; in the Preparations sub table.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt; a User triggers the external action on the Preparation Sub table to get weigh measurements&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The System shall show a Dialog Window to the User that diplays both the Verification and Calibration Due Date of the selected balance as follows:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Calibration Due Date (Interface, Signals) = Calibration Due Date (Biovia Hub)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Verification Due Date (Interface, Signals) = Verification Due Date (Biovia Hub)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Note:
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Soonest verification / calibration due date if there are multiple Biovia event types&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Date/Time format Cal and Ver due dates: dd-MMM-yyyy hh:mm TMZ where TMZ is Local Timezone of logged in User (UCT + x amount of offset time)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The User shall be able to assess (with the help of conditional cell formatting) whether the Balance Verification and Calibration due dates are within the valid time period for GxP Usage:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If Verification Due Date/Time (Biovia Hub) &amp;lt; Current Date/Time -&amp;gt; Red Color&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If Verification event not existing (Biovia Hub) -&amp;gt; Yellow Color&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If Verification Due Date/Time (Biovia Hub) &amp;gt; Current Date/Time -&amp;gt; Green Color&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If Calibration Due Date/Time (Biovia Hub) &amp;lt; Current Date/Time -&amp;gt; Red Color&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If Calibration event not existing (Biovia Hub) -&amp;gt; Yellow Color&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If Calibration Due Date/Time (Biovia Hub) &amp;gt; current date -&amp;gt; Green Color&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</customfieldvalue>

                        </customfieldvalues>
                    </customfield>
